---
config:
  theme: default
description: >-
  Label icons (@mermaid-js/plugin-icons, I3 #324) in messages, a note, a participant and a loop
  label, in the default theme. fa:fa-bell is filled with currentColor, fal:fa-circle-check
  stroked with it: both take the label's text colour, so the four theme families differ by
  colour only (D215, D227).
---
sequenceDiagram
  participant A as fa:fa-bell Alarm
  participant U as User
  A->>U: fa:fa-bell ring
  U-->>A: fal:fa-circle-check stop
  Note over A,U: fal:fa-circle-check acknowledged
  loop fa:fa-bell every minute
    A->>U: fa:fa-bell again
  end
